{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207420","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320742001:2":{"text":"너, 너무 신기해요! 멜로디만 들었을 뿐인데 장면이 느껴져요!","source_cn":"好、好神奇！只是听着旋律，好像能感受到画面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC188B7ABCD69053A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320742002:1":{"text":"날개를 펄럭이는 흰 새, 사막에서 질주하는 영양... 제가 모르는 동물을 아주 많이 본 것 같아요.","source_cn":"我好像看见了挥动翅膀的白鸟，在沙漠里奔跑的羚羊……看见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AAA5B0ABDC1A3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320742003:1":{"text":"다들 날고, 뛰고, 장난을 치고 있어요...","source_cn":"它们在飞，在跳，在打闹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363FB161883E9F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320742004:1":{"text":"만져보고 싶어요... 그들 곁으로 가고 싶어요.","source_cn":"我想摸摸他们……想到他们身边去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2FE0A8628801C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320742005:1":{"text":"바렐... 할 수 있어! 하지만 치료에 전념해야 해. 의사 선생님께서 준 약도 먹지 않는다면 어떻게 회복할 수 있겠어?","source_cn":"巴维尔……你可以的！但是你要安心治疗，如果连医生给的药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CDFFCB94424DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320742006:1":{"text":"정말 회복할 수 있을까요...? 이런 병은 회복하기 어렵다고 들었어요... 전 이미 눈이 먼 거예요.","source_cn":"我真的能恢复吗……我听说，这种病很难恢复……我已经瞎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C821673678ED2AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320742007:1":{"text":"지금도 볼 수 있지 않아? 네가 경치를 볼 수 있을지 없을지를 결정하는 건, 네 눈이 아니라 마음이야.","source_cn":"你现在也能看见，不是吗？决定你能否看见风景的，不是你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494051649F1DFF60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320742008:1":{"text":"네 마음으로 네 눈을 믿어. 넌 분명 다시 모험을 떠날 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"用你的心，相信你的眼睛。你一定可以再次踏上冒险的旅途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A9B993847E4B5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320742009:1":{"text":"내 마음...","source_cn":"我的心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F69226D0C82D9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320742010:1":{"text":"알겠어요. 믿으려고 노력할게요!","source_cn":"我知道了，我会试着相信它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95ACEB44A60B2EE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320742011:1":{"text":"로잔 형, 고마워요!","source_cn":"洛桑哥哥，谢谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0BB98AD85085152","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320742012:1":{"text":"네가 회복하면 같이 모험을 떠날 기회가 생길지도 모르니까 꼭 나아야 해.","source_cn":"等你康复了，说不定我们还有机会一起去冒险呢，一定要好起来啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4463D8B22D6ABFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320742013:1":{"text":"응!","source_cn":"嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D6558626784D6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1320742014:1":{"text":"며칠 동안, 로잔은 종종 얼음 결정으로 아름다운 음악을 연주했다. 이건 로잔만이 생각해 낼 수 있는 기이하고도 기가 막힌 주문이었다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800378BC80B3F28E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1320742015:1":{"text":"며칠 뒤...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ADC8B71D8833C9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巴维尔":{"text":"바렐","source":"巴维尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:娜杰卡":{"text":"나즈카","source":"娜杰卡","st